      "body_html": "My friend Rob Co and I were fortunate to get the opportunity to tour Drew Martinez's Sarracenia collection.  We must have spent 3-4 hours digesting all the different clones he has-it was great to see his collection thriving:<br/><br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s3.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s5.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s16.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>Kimber red ruffles(from Mike King):<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s8.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>another shot:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s6.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/>a s. flava var. cuprea from mike king:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s9.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>same plant:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s10.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>S. purpurea ssp. purpurea f-1 lake district of Muskoka, ON-this thing got really big:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s20.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>S. leucophylla hurricane creek white clone F-this had a huge pitcher on it:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s17.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>S. flava 'bronze' (dean cook):<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s26.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>veinless S. purpurea ssp. purpurea:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s31.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>S. psittacina 'large red' Calhoun County, FL-this plant was bigger than mine!<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s30.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>Doreen's colossus with Drew in the background:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s15.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/>S. flava var. rubricorpora 'claret' f25c:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s35.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>S. flava var. rubricorpora Liberty Co, FL clone M:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s48.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/><br/>Huge pitchers on this S. x Leah Wilkerson:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s39.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>another shot:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s47.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><br/>And a last shot with Rob in the background:<br/><img src=\"http://i1110.photobucket.com/albums/h443/meizzwang/s46.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>",
